{"v":4,"catch":"在大規模的銀河戰爭中贏得決定性的戰鬥！","desc":"“GALAGA'88”是 NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於 1987 年發行的射擊遊戲。\nGALAGA 部隊已經返回，您必須跨越維度並戰鬥到 Planet Galaga 以結束戰爭。\n這個標題讓您可以使用 3 個鏈接的 FIGHTERS 來獲得三重戰鬥機。 用它強大的火力消滅敵人！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。\n\n*選項菜單和手冊有日語，英語，法語，德語，意大利語和西班牙語。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-04-27","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6e21e3dc3a1cda989fa3680b55a1a8ac987c2bf51c6f1e6256e38afec4a5ce9e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c7d508e38be3996fcbe39bdb271dee18cb06a3fca3be1f816ca5c95dc6f18fdb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3a5417dedbf0bd9505dc15aa93d546bbb26a5f8bc0a132567f45be4661ee0a34.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/35b6fd7087a1757d7fada95e2aa9f7803a4092280fa418ddad59f201af911bad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/33b60ccd0949685d48db6ca39f1f2bee7a725af082f2975b0717473690a1a324.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e290e8eb3d0bd8fe517a9bfbf3a841013585a679f86d58f78f1a7f83211c183a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100da401a684000","dlc":[]}